<section image-layout="blank" id="ujNngJlTI9"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="7x8X53Gp5q"><labels><label variant="solid">REQUEST · CONTROL MAP</label></labels><h2>Controls mapped to concrete failures</h2><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="fill"><grid-item id="r2YPFZRxpR" colspan="44"><table col-widths="[34,66]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding: 3pt 9pt;"><tr><th><p>Failure</p></th><th><p>Concrete control</p></th></tr><tr><td><p><b>Credential guessing</b></p></td><td><p>Rate-limit login attempts and return one generic failure.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Injection</b></p></td><td><p>Validate input and use parameterized database queries.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Session fixation</b></p></td><td><p>Regenerate the session identifier after authentication.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Cookie exposure</b></p></td><td><p>Use HTTPS plus HttpOnly, Secure, and SameSite=Lax to reduce exposure and cross-site sending.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>CSRF</b></p></td><td><p>Verify a server-issued token on state-changing forms.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Broken access control</b></p></td><td><p><code>requireRole('admin')</code> returns 403 to an authenticated student.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>Logout replay</b></p></td><td><p>Destroy server state and clear <code>sid</code>.</p></td></tr></table><p role="caption">Sources: <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authentication_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Authentication</a> · <a href="https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Session_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html">OWASP Session Management</a>.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="XTgdBmAEeQ" align="center" vertical-align="center" colspan="16"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/WF8jRRoCdqwSkRZ96si9d.png" saved-media-id="ybanp5mvssauesg" source="image.ai-generated" width="190pt" height="190pt" image-style="secure-stack-isometric" alt="Isometric security shield enclosing a session vault and opaque cookie capsule" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1440,&quot;height&quot;:1440}"/><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="stVAQ6EMuf" background-color="surface" cell-decor="top-line" padding="10pt 13pt"><p role="eyebrow">COOKIE DEFENSE</p><h4>HTTPS · HttpOnly · Secure · SameSite=Lax</h4><p font-size="sm">Defense in depth—not a guarantee against every theft path.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>